Q: php Mac Address check format A: <p>I would simplify your code like this</p>
<p>Define a function to be reused in multiple scenarios (Which would only accept <code>&quot;:&quot;</code>)</p>
<pre><code>function validate_mac_address($mac_address){
    $valid_mac_address=false;
    if(preg_match('/^([a-fA-F0-9]{2}:){5}[a-fA-F0-9]{2}$/', $mac_address) == 1){
        $valid_mac_address=true;
    }
  return ($valid_mac_address);
}
</code></pre>
